{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"desktop-and-mobile-apps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Desktop and mobile apps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Electron, Tauri, Electrobun and Capacitor show your pages in a browser engine, so Kirana works in\nthem as it does on the web. The bundler that builds the app's frontend runs Kirana,\nand the stylesheet ships inside the app. Each guide below is tested by an example\nwhose frontend is built and checked in Chromium on every change."}]},{"type":"component","name":"guides","attributes":{"group":"desktop"},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"which-engine-renders-your-pages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which engine renders your pages"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shell"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Engine"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Electron"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Its own Chromium, the same version on every platform"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tauri"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"WebView2 (Chromium) on Windows, WKWebView on macOS and iOS, WebKitGTK on Linux, Android WebView"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Electrobun"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The system's webview (WebView2, WKWebView, WebKitGTK), or a bundled Chromium (CEF)"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capacitor"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"WKWebView on iOS, Android WebView"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"set-targets-to-the-oldest-engine-you-support","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"targets"},{"type":"text","value":" to the oldest engine you support"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana compiles for "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chrome 123, Safari 17.5, Firefox 120"}]},{"type":"text","value":" unless told otherwise. Electron\nships its own Chromium, far above that floor, so it needs nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The system webviews update with the operating system: an app that supports older\nmacOS, iOS or Linux releases runs on an older WebKit. Set\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/reference/config#targets","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"targets","source":"targets"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" to the oldest one, and Kirana lowers\nwhat that engine lacks:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import { defineConfig } from \"@kirana-style/core/config\"\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  // macOS 13 and iOS 16 ship Safari 16.\n  targets: { safari: 16 },\n})","lang":"ts","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { defineConfig } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/core/config&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">defineConfig</span>({\n  <span class=\"th-token th-comment\">// macOS 13 and iOS 16 ship Safari 16.</span>\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">targets</span>: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">safari</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-number\">16</span> },\n})","file":"kirana.config.ts","title":"kirana.config.ts"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The build then reports "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"target-lowering","source":"target-lowering"}},{"type":"text","value":", so you see what was lowered."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-stays-the-same","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What stays the same"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"One stylesheet"}]},{"type":"text","value":", imported once in the frontend's entry. There is no server, so\nnothing is rendered twice."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Development"}]},{"type":"text","value":" runs the shell against the bundler's dev server: styles update as\nyou save, as in the browser."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The editor, the linter and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> check","source":"kirana-style check"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" work on the frontend's files\nas on any web project."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"desktop-and-mobile-apps","text":"Desktop and mobile apps","level":1},{"id":"which-engine-renders-your-pages","text":"Which engine renders your pages","level":2},{"id":"set-targets-to-the-oldest-engine-you-support","text":"Set targets to the oldest engine you support","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2}]}
